<!--TeacherLine shorthand-->
(set: _line to (hook: "TeacherLine"))

The landlady who sold you the Askavan ginger has spoken highly of the root's medicinal properties. But the only thing it seems to cure is the expectant smile on your mentor's face, which disappears as you produce from your bag the ginger and not the medicine he was expecting.
<br>
_line["Oh."]
<br>
He does not even look at the ginger; he only looks at you as though you have just defecated in front of him instead of the other way around.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->The locals say that this traditional remedy can cure all kinds of illnesses.\"", "localSays",
     "\"<!--B-->You don't seem entirely pleased.\"", "notPleased",
     "\"<!--C-->Sorry.\"", "sorry",
))
<br>

<!--localSays-->
[
_line["I'm sure they do,"] he says, staring at you, unblinking. _line["How much... did they charge you?"]
(show: ?howMuch)
](localSays|


<!--notPleased-->
[
_line["What makes you... think that?"] He asks with a snort. _line["How much... did they ask from you?"]
(show: ?howMuch)
](notPleased|


<!--sorry-->
[
_line["Hmm..."] he says. _line["How much... was it?"]
(show: ?howMuch)
](sorry|


<!--howMuch-->
[
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
