))
<br>
](30|


<!--10-->
[
_line["Ten rials. A whole day's... worth of rent?"]
<br>
He takes the ginger and drops it into the puke bucket beside his bed.
<br>
_line["You know there are homeless people... out there in the streets of Apesai, yes? Good... Let that be a lesson."]
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
